  {
   "idx": 2,
   "zh": "（2026年9月24日，华盛顿） 中华人民共和国主席 习近平 尊敬的特朗普总统和梅拉尼娅女士， 女士们，先生们，朋友们：",
   "en": "Honorable President Donald J. Trump and Mrs. Melania Trump, Ladies and Gentlemen, Dear Friends,",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    4,
    8
   ],
   "ep": [
    9,
    11
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "很高兴对美丽的美利坚合众国进行国事访问，感谢特朗普总统和夫人给予我和我夫人的热情款待。首先，我谨代表14亿多中国人民，向美国人民致以诚挚问候，向美国独立250周年表示热烈祝贺！",
   "en": "I’m very glad to pay a state visit to your beautiful country, the United States of America. Thank you, President Trump and Mrs. Trump, for the warm hospitality you have extended to me and my wife. On behalf of the 1.4 billion and more Chinese people, I wish to begin by extending sincere greetings to the American people and warm congratulations on the 250th anniversary of the American independence.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    13,
    13
   ],
